title: The Problems panel opens beside the canvas with nothing to list in a folder no extension reports on, and closes again
folders: typescript
limit: 40
forbid-log: WARN.*script
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left problems
wait 1000
mark problems-empty
wait 450
left files
wait 600
left problems
wait 800
left none
wait 600
mark closed
wait 450
quit
